      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Peter%20Dasler\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Peter Dasler</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2004 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Dasler has over 40 years of experience in the mining and exploration industry. He has been a director and officer of several public companies and has extensive experience in the management of exploration projects.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Cory%20Belyk\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Cory Belyk</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2021 May)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">CEO</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Belyk is a professional geologist with over 30 years of experience in the mining industry, including 25 years with Cameco Corporation in various senior roles.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Harry%20Chan\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px da